  "planning_notes": [
    "Uno is selected. Physical wiring follows the given authoritative pins: Entry HC-SR04 Trig=D8 Echo=D9; Exit HC-SR04 Trig=D10 Echo=D11; DHT11 pin=D7; Fan PWM pin=D5; TM1637 CLK=D4 DIO=D3; button pin=D2.",
    "Ultrasonic timeout_us set to 30000 (within 25000..60000). Sample period rounding to a control-period multiple is handled by the runtime per specification; business decisions for counting are implemented in the SysML model.",
    "DHT temperature/humidity/validity share the same pin (D7) as required for DHT11.",
    "Digital button polarity: assumed active-high with pullup enabled (pressed=1). If the actual button is wired differently (active-low), SysML should change the button interpretation accordingly.",
    "TM1637 initial command is set to 0 so that startup displays 0 people; model logic will switch display content when D2 is pressed.",
    "Serial: exact requested serial protocol was not specified beyond baud/framing, so a single periodic status-group is assumed. The trigger is model-controlled and must be driven according to the application's desired report cadence."
